674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ArXrjRsfnq4Q7kNvwFCMQHH&_nc_oc=AdrlgTJrTnqQM35_9rzi7JgfwJBzW374TcXk8xW0MNn9KY5T39lFR8BADouGHhU5VN0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFF-jFO6Hh0ZCmifw3eqqB2pbQKxUCO88Z1Y_LiK18PMg&oe=6A71F7D9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6GwHctah63YQ7kNvwFsiy-8&_nc_oc=Adr-Skk4Un5X6NXEccjy6XNOFcOPYmxDI4f_HhT1Yh5Tma2AREzo-gtxcsC_a6Bs17Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHUT1kHYxb09693hJKqBygbSZaHFPNMEC7jul2J_SqxMA&oe=6A720096"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NLd89Jg0ajcQ7kNvwGu8LpA&_nc_oc=AdqL7jV9iIjfAH_hfo9bPS0z_biXkkEhCZVXV7oQeojusA8b-7gNOcHnKo0fuvz7P20&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEYOUIMEnHjuDHaEOyMiXn8xn7yAmSV37dQVojnCzTJjA&oe=6A71FCB1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip